	},
	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=3000, wait=1500, sync=1},
		{"sestop", id=1, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=2, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=3, time=1500},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=3000, wait=1500, sync=1},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat030010"},
		line=910,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"We bound across the rooftops until we finally reach Yogarasu District.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"The enemy shouldn't pursue us this far.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"We alight from the rooftops and blend into the bustle of the busy streets.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"None of us have any words for each other.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"Our last sight of Maki's receding figure has silenced us all.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"I've been reflecting on it ever since─",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"The nobility of the spirit of one named Maki Kazuma.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"We eventually make it back to the shop, wary of pursuers all the while.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"Though it's already nearly daybreak, the manager is still waiting for us with a victory toast of amazake.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Ah, thank Oomikami! You're safe.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Our apologies for worrying you.”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“As long as you're safe...”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“But that said, you're all covered in scratches.”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Could we ask you to Heal us again?”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“But of course.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“I figured you'd end up like this, so I filled up on lots of virile foods!”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Freshwater eel, softshell turtle, pit viper...”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"The manager lists off each dish on his fingers with a grin.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"He's acting so normally that it inadvertently cuts the string of my tension.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“By the way, did you happen to encounter Maki-san?”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"The manager withdraws a letter from his breast pocket.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“He left this with me.”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“His instructions were to deliver this to you when you returned from the Imperial Palace.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"The elegantly textured envelope bears no outside markings.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"I gently unfurl the high-quality paper.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“This letter has been opened already. The creases are misaligned.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Really now? I didn't open it.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"The manager questioningly cocks his head.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"Oh, well. For now, let's read what it says.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"I'm greeted by neat rows of uncharacteristically elegant handwriting.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“'If you're reading this letter, that means someone must've finally taken me out.'”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“'I sincerely hope that it was Inou.'”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Maki was expecting me to kill him...?”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"Hotori's eyes widen at this revelation.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“'Inou, you've always had the strength in you to be\nchairman.'”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“'So it's about goddamn time for you to step out from under Kokuan's shadow.'”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“'A smarter man than me could've probably inspired you with his words, but you know I'm too heavy-handed for\nthat.'”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“'I hope you can someday forgive me for never having anything decent to say and always picking fights.'”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“'A long while back, Kokuan taught me that ‘the blade may convey what mere words cannot.’'”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“'So I'm going to take him at his word.'”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“'I pray that you found what you needed to in your battle with me.'”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“'Inou, hold your head up high.'”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“'Everyone's been waiting to see you at your true\npotential.'”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"So Kokuan-dono was the one who first said “the blade may convey what mere words cannot”?",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"Maki intended to use his own life to give Hotori the confidence she needed.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"All of his provocations during their battle in the Imperial Palace must have been meant to rouse her fighting spirit.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Maki... I'm sorry.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“If only I'd hardened my resolve a little sooner...”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"Hotori murmurs, biting her lip hard enough to draw blood.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"At the end of the letter, Maki leaves his final directive for the warriors of the Koubukan.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“'You have my sincerest gratitude for serving a man like\nme.'”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“'The legacy of House Maki ends with me, but I believe that the teachings of the Koubukan will always remain in your\nhearts.'”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“'The Koubukan's fealty will forever be this and nothing\nelse:'”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“'Fearlessly leading the way on every last battlefield for the sake of our Empress.'”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“'Under Inou Hotori, I want you to remain united in purpose and see your fealty through to the end.'”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“'I've given the acting chairman more hell than anyone, but she ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"is",
{"/font"},
" a worthy Executor of the warriors' will. On the honor of House Maki, this I hereby swear.'”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"With this letter, even the Koubukan warriors will surely obey Hotori.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"Maki... You have my gratitude.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"When she finishes reading the letter, Hotori wordlessly turns her head up towards the sky.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"Her tightly drawn lips well up with determination for the future.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"The humble restaurant Miyoshi─",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"In this hour right at the cusp of dawn, a certain someone stands on guard in front of the entrance.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"Sarashina Mutsumi.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"She is the head of House Sarashina, one of the Three Founders, as well as the blademaster of Miyoshi's kitchen.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"Even she herself is unsure of why she is still standing here.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"She merely stepped outside because she inexplicably felt like someone was beckoning her.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"Her hair drifting in the chill spring breeze, Mutsumi stares at a faraway point in the city.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"Her line of sight points straight towards the Imperial Palace, the residence of the Empress.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Kazuma-sama...”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"Her thin lips sound out a certain man's name.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"The sight of that man braving a hail of bullets surfaces in\nMutsumi's mind.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"A hopelessly graceless man who does nothing but make a mess of things.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
{"font", size=53},
"At the same time, an admirably straightforward man whose purity of spirit and concern for the Sworn Blades and the disciples of the Koubukan are eclipsed by nobody else.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"Thinking on it now, all manner of Kazuma's likenesses are engraved upon Mutsumi's heart.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"The day they charged side-by-side through that hellish battlefield─",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"The day the Three Founders swore an oath to join forces and restore the Empire─",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"The day she stopped Kazuma from taking his own life after the August Incident─",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"The day after Kokuan's arrest where they vowed to strengthen the Sworn Blades in the only ways they could─",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"It was in the aftermath of the August Incident that Mutsumi and Maki's relationship underwent a decisive change.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"When Maki learned that a disciple of the Koubukan had leaked information to the Republic, he committed seppuku in the Imperial Temple.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"Concerned that she was unable to reach him, it was Mutsumi who discovered him on the verge of bleeding out.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"If Mutsumi had arrived even a few moments later, Kazuma would have departed from this world.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Kazuma? What are you doing?!”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“...Oh... Mutsumi... huh?”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"When Mutsumi comes across Kazuma, his life is on the very precipice of being extinguished.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"Finding him drowning in an expanding pool of his own blood, Mutsumi does not hesitate to cradle him up in her arms. ",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Just... let me die...”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Don't be ridiculous.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"Kazuma expends the last of his strength pushing away\nMutsumi's hands as she tries to stem his bleeding.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“One of my boys... got played by a woman...”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“That's why... the Republic... knew about...”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“How awful...”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Right? Can't go on... living anymore... can I?”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"Mutsumi understands Kazuma's feelings all too well.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"Were she to be in his position, she would have surely committed seppuku as well.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“...You can't.”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I refuse to let you die.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“The hell are you...”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“You're always making a mess of things. I won't let you get off so easily this time.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Do you expect me to hold up the Sworn Blades all by myself?”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“If you want to take responsibility, then live on and fulfill your duty! You coward!”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“You...”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Nuuoohh?!”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"Mutsumi heaves Kazuma's enormous frame onto her back.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"His blood immediately begins to seep into her clothes.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“D-Don't you... have any sympathy... for a fellow warrior?”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Just let me die, dammit...”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“I don't know... how I can face the Blades... after what's happened...”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Shut up.”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“If you keep whining, I'll throw you.”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"With that, Mutsumi does not say another word.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"Step by step, hoisting a body enormous enough to hide her completely from view, she descends the stairs to the temple.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Knock yourself out... you asshole...”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“(I wonder if he'll come stumbling back covered in wounds like last time.)”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"Remembering her younger days, Mutsumi unconsciously breaks into a smile.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"In the same moment, a single shooting star races across the sky over the Imperial Palace.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“(Ah...)”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"The brilliant streak of light lasts for only the briefest of moments.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"Pure and ephemeral, it is swallowed up by the darkness just as soon as it appears.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Kazuma-sama...”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"A single tear traces itself down Mutsumi's cheek.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“...Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"An enormous object falls from the sky.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"Any onlookers would surely mistake it for a bloodied bear as it flounders about in the middle of the road.",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“*Cough! Cough, cough...!* Fuck me... I'm beat...”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“That blonde chick... is one tough customer...”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Kazuma-sama...?!”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Hmm?”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"Mutsumi rushes up to Kazuma quickly enough to leave her sandals behind in her wake.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Tch... It's always gotta be you, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“W-Were you not supposed to be dead?!”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Hey, don't go killing me off, dumbass.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“But that shooting star...”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“The hell're you on about?”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“N-Nothing...”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"Within her heart, Mutsumi vows to never again underestimate Kazuma's ability to defy death.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Well, I was plannin' on dying...”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“But those Republicans were so goddamn spineless I\nwould've felt like a dumbass if I let 'em kill me.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“*Cough! Cough, cough!*”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"The blood spilling from his mouth stains Mutsumi's clothes.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"Even as they speak, the blood spilling from Kazuma's body is gradually slickening the road's surface.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"The scales of his life are tipping heavier and heavier toward death.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"There isn't a moment to waste.",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Remember? I refuse to let you die.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			{
"Just like last time, Mutsumi heaves Kazuma onto her back.",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Heh... Tryna talk you out of it is gonna be like wrestlin' a pig, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"am",
{"/font"},
" quite experienced with that, after all.”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"Step by step, Mutsumi carries this now-familiar weight.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"Kazuma's consciousness grows dim from the gentle swaying and comfortable warmth of her back.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Knock yourself out... you asshole...”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			{
"The next morning, Hotori sends an emergency summons to all the members of the Blades.",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"The purpose of the meeting is to explain the events of\nKokuan-dono's rescue operation and to disclose the news of Maki's death.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“This ends Maki's last will and testament.”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“This is, of course, his handwriting. It also bears his seal.”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"After reading out Maki's letter, I hold it up for the warriors to see.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"At first, the Koubukan warriors looked at me with disbelief in their eyes, but eventually, they all hang their heads and begin to silently weep.",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			{
"Seeing this number of teary-eyed warriors makes me realize the extent of Maki's influence.",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"In truth, Hotori and I already received news from Mutsumi-san of Maki's survival.",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"But Maki himself requested that we keep it a secret until the time is right, and we decided to go along with it.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"This too is for the sake of the Sworn Blades.",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“In the course of our latest operation, we have lost an irreplaceable comrade in Maki Kazuma.”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“This blunder was entirely the fault of my own incompetence.”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“To everyone here, and above all, to Maki himself, I offer my sincerest apologies.”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"At Hotori's command, we hold a moment of silence for Maki.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“He gave up his own life to redress my lack of maturity.”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Henceforth, with Maki's last words in my heart, I am resolved to work ever more diligently until the day we fulfill our ultimate duty.”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“As for those gathered, all I ask is for your continued support of the Sworn Blades.”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"Hotori's sharp gaze conveys the strength of her conviction to every last one of the assembled warriors.",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Additionally, there were no signs in the Imperial Palace of my father, Inou Kokuan.”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“As of now, his survival remains unknown.”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“However, we shall not devote any more of the Blades' resources to his search and rescue.”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			{
"Headquarters is abuzz at this declaration.",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"In her heart of hearts, Hotori likely still believes Kokuan-dono is alive.",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"Nonetheless, she has called off his search of her own accord.",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			{
"No longer is she the Hotori of the past who clung to\nKokuan-dono's shadow.",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			{
"Maki─",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			{
"You have my thanks.",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Attention!”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“As of this moment, I hereby assume the position of chairman of the Sworn Blades.”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“To all those gathered here today, I vow to fight to my last breath for the restoration of the Empire!”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"Headquarters is filled with a solemn silence.",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			{
"Hotori has terminated the search for Kokuan-dono and inherited the position of chairman.",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"A new era of the Sworn Blades is upon us.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Any who would object, name yourself here and now.”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			{
"A warrior who had been Maki's right-hand man steps forward.",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Young Warrior"},
			{
"“As devotees of the Koubukan, we have faithfully served Maki-dono to this point.”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Young Warrior"},
			{
"“In accordance with his dying wish, we hereby pledge to devote ourselves to the Sworn Blades with every fiber of our being.”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"The warriors of the Maki faction lower their heads as one.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Your words are most reliable.”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Let us join forces and fulfill our sworn duty!”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“That would be the greatest tribute we could pay to Maki-dono.”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Young Warrior"},
			{
"“We hear and obey.”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			{
"Hotori faces the gathered warriors once again and raises Shiranui aloft.",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"Every last eye in the room is drawn to its magnificent craftsmanship.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			{
"She has taken up Shiranui─",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			{
"There is no warrior who would fail to grasp the significance of this act.",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			{
"Inou Hotori shall take responsibility for the lives of all the warriors and carry out their will as their Executor.",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			{
"This is her declaration.",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You, the Empress's faithful chosen...”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Unworthy though Inou Hotori may be, she humbly asks for your loyalty.”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			{
"The collective roar of assent shakes the very foundations of the headquarters.",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You have my thanks.”",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"Hotori lowers her head in gratitude.",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			{
"She proceeds to turn and face the altar behind her.",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			{
"At this signal, everyone stands and loosens their blades in their sheaths.",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			{
"A pristine silence descends upon the room.",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			{
"This is the first Ringing of Inou Hotori, chairman of the Sworn Blades.",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“With Oomikami as our witness, we of the Sworn Blades solemnly affirm our steel-firm solidarity and pledge allegiance to Her Imperial Majesty.”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Any who would break this oath must by rights offer their life in atonement.”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“For allegiance!”",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			{
"The clarion sound heralds a new dawn for the Sworn Blades.",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			{
"The astonishingly clarion sound ushers in the dawn of a new age.",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			{
"The Sworn Blades shall grieve no longer.",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			{
"That we might honor the sacrifices of all those who came before us, let us stand against the invaders as one.",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			{
"By our powers combined, may we take down Okonogi and reclaim the Empire.",
			},
		},
	},
